{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_3b105f84ba2154e987ae0ed3ec93550f58bb04873265bde7e0d18ddc587a405a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per ADR-0002, a durable local SQLite store at ~/.tokentelemetry/history.db is upserted on every background scan, storing raw facts so analytics history survives agents pruning their transcripts; derived insights are recomputed at read time."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e21e58a6811eb912023a3110359ae1675479d67c3a55ac9a7443bc11a165363a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per ADR-0002, history capture starts from the first run (already-pruned transcripts are unrecoverable), pruned sessions without archival show only in aggregates, and transcript archival currently resolves single-file transcripts only for claude/codex."}],"claim_ids":["clm_3b105f84ba2154e987ae0ed3ec93550f58bb04873265bde7e0d18ddc587a405a","clm_e21e58a6811eb912023a3110359ae1675479d67c3a55ac9a7443bc11a165363a"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7","id":"pg_926fa1f690ba5f8fa735562b68475b64","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/vasihemanth-tokentelemetry-docs-adr-0002-durable-history-rollup-md-0d6-562b68475b64.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_8b22c0c487725df3a006c5c586923d12"],"title":"VasiHemanth/tokentelemetry/docs/adr/0002-durable-history-rollup.md @ 0d691ae343ed","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e54358f79f1848a7a3f5bcc95eab5dd7"}
